    "title": "Isaiah Likely's 41 catches give the Giants a matchup to exploit - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alexander Wilson ,\n8 hours ago\nThe Giants found an offensive matchup they should keep feeding, even as their quarterback situation changes. Isaiah Likely has 41 catches through seven games, one short of his previous career high. Only two other tight ends have topped 40 receptions in their first seven games with a team, the Giants noted.\nRead full article",
